OL,3,GNEWSAOrchard owner devastated by busway
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a century-old orchard said
OL,7,Fit felt like a loved one had been
OL,8,F"given a terminal diagnosis", after the
OL,9,Fgovernment approved a #192m busway that
OL,10,Fwill run straight through it.
OL,12,FThe project known as C2C, linking 8.6
OL,13,Fmiles (13.8km) between Cambridge and
OL,14,FCambourne, hopes to provide 10,000
OL,15,Fdaily passenger trips.
OL,17,FIt was given the go-ahead on Tuesday,
OL,18,Fbut the route will go through Coton
OL,19,FOrchard, whose owner Anna Gazeley said
OL,20,Fshe felt "bereaved".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
